  "lang": "en",
  "description": [
    "A tetracyclic diterpenoid isolated originally from the bark of the Pacific yew tree, <em>Taxus brevifolia</em>. It is a mitotic inhibitor used in cancer chemotherapy. Note that the use of the former generic name 'taxol' is now limited, as Taxol is a registered trade mark."
  ],
